{"seq":223,"elapsed_ms":3459,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need answer only DUT between [BEGIN] and [DONE]. Need implement TopModule DFF positive edge, async reset ar likely active high? Spec \"asynchronous reset 'ar'\". In HDLBits m2014 q4b maybe D flip-flop with asynchronous reset. Usually ar means asynchronous reset, active high. Need q <= 0 on ar, else d on posedge clk. Let's ensure syntax SystemVerilog. module TopModule(input clk, input ar, input d, output reg q); always @(posedge clk or posedge ar) if (ar) q <= 1'b0; else q <= d; endmodule. Return exactly one complete DUT between markers."}}}
{"seq":224,"elapsed_ms":3461,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  clk,\n    input  ar,\n    input  d,\n    output reg q\n);\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge ar) begin\n        if (ar)\n            q <= 1'b0;\n        else\n            q <= d;\n    end\nendmodule\n[DONE]"}}}
